0 FILE vesper-quickreturn.ldr
0 Vesper - Quick-Return Shaper
0 Name: vesper-quickreturn.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/vesper-quickreturn.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Vesper design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // A full-turn crank drives a slotted lever and passive guided shaper ram.
0 // One full-turn motor crank drives the linkage; the output is passive.
0 // All motion comes from stock connections and unmodified native physics.
0 // Companion: vesper-quickreturn.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Use the supplied program to test full-turn motion in both directions.
0 // Digital kinematic demonstrator; physical assembly and output loading are untested.
